package api

// sswCurriculumForestryEnglish contains exact, hand-reviewed translations for
// forestry SSW learning material.
var sswCurriculumForestryEnglish = map[examSSWEnglishKey]string{
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Berjalan dengan kecepatan yang memungkinkan melihat pijakan, jangan melewati bawah pohon atau cabang yang tampak tidak stabil, dan tandai bahaya sesuai aturan kru. Jika tanah bergerak atau jarak pandang turun, beri tahu tim dan tunggu arahan. Jangan mencoba memindahkan pohon atau batu berat sendirian.

Kasus latihan: Setelah hujan, jalur ke titik kerja memiliki tanah yang ambles dan satu cabang besar menggantung di atas lintasan.
Respons yang dianjurkan: Jangan melewati titik itu. Beri tanda atau jarak aman sesuai aturan kru dan laporkan agar pemimpin memilih jalur atau tindakan aman.`}: `Walk at a pace that lets you see where you are stepping. Do not pass beneath a tree or branch that appears unstable; mark hazards as the crew requires. If the ground shifts or visibility drops, notify the team and wait for instructions. Do not try to move a tree or heavy rock alone.

Practice scenario: After rain, the path to the work site has subsided ground, and a large branch hangs over the route.
Suggested response: Do not pass that point. Mark it or keep a safe distance as the crew requires, and report it so the leader can choose a safe route or action.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bibit yang sehat dan sesuai petak membantu tegakan tumbuh merata. Pekerja memeriksa jenis dan jumlah menurut catatan, menjaga akar tetap terlindung, serta mengikuti jarak atau tanda penanaman. Cara tanam mengikuti arahan teknis setempat; pekerja pemula tidak mengubah posisi, kedalaman, atau jenis tanpa bertanya.`}: `Healthy seedlings suited to the plot help the stand grow evenly. Check their species and quantity against the records, protect their roots, and follow the specified spacing or planting marks. Follow local technical instructions; new workers must not change the position, depth, or species without asking.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Catat petak, waktu, arah, dan tanda yang dapat diamati; jangan menyebut penyebab jika belum diketahui. Bila ada asap atau api, beri tahu kru melalui saluran darurat dan ikuti rute evakuasi. Jangan menyentuh wadah bocor atau mengangkut limbah menggunakan kendaraan tanpa arahan.

Kasus latihan: Pekerja melihat asap tipis dan bau hangus dari area yang belum diperiksa.
Respons yang dianjurkan: Jauhi area, beri tahu kru dan pemimpin melalui jalur darurat, lalu ikuti rute evakuasi yang ditentukan.`}: `Record the plot, time, direction, and observable signs; do not state a cause that has not been established. If there is smoke or fire, alert the crew through the emergency channel and follow the evacuation route. Do not touch a leaking container or transport waste by vehicle without instructions.

Practice scenario: A worker sees light smoke and smells something burning in an area that has not been inspected.
Suggested response: Stay away, alert the crew and leader through the emergency channel, and follow the designated evacuation route.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Cocokkan label atau tanda pada kayu dengan catatan kerja sebelum memindahkan. Pisahkan hasil tanpa tanda atau dengan identitas tidak cocok di lokasi yang ditentukan. Catat jumlah aktual dan kondisi yang terlihat, lalu minta pemimpin memastikan kelompok tujuan; jangan menggabungkan kayu dari petak berbeda tanpa instruksi.

Kasus latihan: Satu batang kayu di tempat pengumpulan tidak memiliki tanda petak, sementara dua kelompok dari petak berbeda sedang disiapkan.
Respons yang dianjurkan: Pisahkan batang itu di tempat tahan, catat lokasi dan kondisi, lalu minta pemimpin menelusuri identitas sebelum dimuat.`}: `Before moving timber, match its label or mark to the work records. Set aside unmarked or mismatched material at the designated location. Record the actual quantity and visible condition, then ask the leader to confirm its destination group. Do not combine timber from different plots without instructions.

Practice scenario: One log at the collection point has no plot mark, while two groups from different plots are being prepared.
Suggested response: Isolate the log in the hold area, record its location and condition, and ask the leader to trace its identity before loading.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Gunakan jalur dan tempat simpan yang ditunjukkan, jangan mencuci alat atau membuang cairan ke aliran. Bila melihat lumpur masuk ke parit atau tanah retak, hentikan pergerakan di titik itu dan beri tahu pemimpin. Ikuti arahan untuk mengamankan area tanpa menutup saluran atau merusak vegetasi.

Kasus latihan: Roda kendaraan meninggalkan alur dalam yang mengarah ke saluran air setelah hujan.
Respons yang dianjurkan: Hentikan kendaraan di tempat aman, laporkan alur dan arah aliran, lalu tunggu keputusan pemimpin mengenai rute berikutnya.`}: `Use the designated routes and storage areas. Do not wash tools or dump liquids into waterways. If you see mud entering a ditch or cracked soil, stop movement at that point and notify the leader. Follow directions to secure the area without blocking a channel or damaging vegetation.

Practice scenario: After rain, a vehicle wheel leaves a deep rut leading toward a water channel.
Suggested response: Stop the vehicle in a safe place, report the rut and direction of flow, then wait for the leader to decide on the next route.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Hasil produksi perlu dikenali menurut petak, jenis, ukuran, atau tujuan sesuai sistem perusahaan. Penandaan menghubungkan kayu dengan catatan dan membantu pemindahan berikutnya. Pekerja hanya mengukur atau memberi tanda menggunakan cara yang diajarkan; perubahan grade atau tujuan tidak boleh dibuat sendiri.`}: `Identify production output by plot, species, size, or destination according to the company's system. Marking links timber to its records and supports later handling. Measure or mark items only by the method you were taught; do not change the grade or destination yourself.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Ikuti tanda petak dan jalur yang telah ditunjukkan. Letakkan alat dengan aman, jaga saluran air dan area yang ditandai, lalu laporkan batas yang tidak terlihat atau berbeda dari peta. Jangan memperlebar jalur atau memindahkan tanda sendiri demi mempercepat pekerjaan.

Kasus latihan: Tanda batas petak tidak terlihat di satu sisi dan jalur kerja mengarah ke dekat aliran air.
Respons yang dianjurkan: Berhenti sebelum batas yang diragukan, hindari memasuki area dekat aliran, dan minta pemimpin mengonfirmasi peta serta tanda.`}: `Follow the plot markers and designated routes. Put tools down safely, protect waterways and marked areas, and report any boundary that is missing or differs from the map. Do not widen a route or move markers to speed up the work.

Practice scenario: A plot boundary marker is missing on one side, and the work route leads close to a stream.
Suggested response: Stop before the uncertain boundary, stay clear of the stream area, and ask the leader to confirm the map and markers.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Kendaraan dan alat pemindah kayu memiliki titik buta, beban yang dapat bergeser, dan area putar. Pekerja tidak berdiri di bawah beban atau di jalur kendaraan, dan hanya operator berwenang yang mengendalikan alat. Isyarat, batas jalur, dan zona tunggu harus dipahami sebelum kru bergerak atau melakukan pemuatan.`}:                                              `Vehicles and timber-moving equipment have blind spots, shifting loads, and turning areas. Never stand beneath a load or in a vehicle route. Only authorized operators may control the equipment. Before movement or loading begins, everyone must understand the signals, route boundaries, and waiting zones.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Medan hutan dapat memiliki lereng licin, akar, lubang, batu lepas, pohon mati, dan cabang menggantung. Pekerja memperhatikan area di atas dan di bawah, menjaga jarak, serta mengikuti jalur yang disetujui. Hujan, angin, kabut, atau kondisi gelap dapat mengubah risiko; penilaian ulang dilakukan bersama pemimpin.`}:                                              `Forest terrain may include slippery slopes, roots, holes, loose rocks, dead trees, and hanging branches. Watch the areas above and below, keep your distance, and use approved routes. Rain, wind, fog, or darkness can change the risks; reassess conditions with the leader.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Pada akhir pekerjaan, kru memastikan orang dan alat lengkap, meninjau petak, dan mencatat hasil sesuai satuan perusahaan. Laporan harus membedakan jumlah yang selesai, kerusakan, material tertahan, dan tugas yang belum dilakukan. Penutupan memastikan masalah lapangan tidak hilang saat kru meninggalkan lokasi.`}:                                               `At the end of the job, confirm that all people and tools are accounted for, review the plot, and record results using company units. Reports must distinguish completed quantities, damage, materials on hold, and unfinished tasks. Closeout ensures field issues are not overlooked when the crew leaves.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Pekerja lapangan dapat menemukan pohon rusak, serangan hama, asap, api, sampah, atau wadah bahan yang bocor. Tindakan awal adalah menjaga jarak, memberi peringatan kepada kru, dan melaporkan lokasi serta ciri yang terlihat. Pengendalian hama, api, atau bahan berbahaya dilakukan oleh orang yang ditunjuk dan sesuai rencana.`}:                                  `Field workers may find damaged trees, pest activity, smoke, fire, rubbish, or leaking containers. First, keep your distance, warn the crew, and report the location and visible signs. Pest control, firefighting, and hazardous-material handling must be carried out by designated people under the applicable plan.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Pekerjaan kehutanan memiliki bahaya dari benda jatuh, alat tajam, mesin, kebisingan, cuaca, dan medan. Perlengkapan seperti helm, pelindung mata atau wajah, pelindung pendengaran, sarung tangan, sepatu kerja, dan pakaian pelindung dipilih menurut tugas dan aturan perusahaan. Tugas dengan gergaji mesin memerlukan pelatihan dan penetapan tugas yang sesuai.`}: `Forestry work involves hazards from falling objects, sharp tools, machinery, noise, weather, and terrain. Select equipment such as a helmet, eye or face protection, hearing protection, gloves, work boots, and protective clothing according to the task and company rules. Chainsaw work requires suitable training and assignment.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Pekerjaan kehutanan mencakup pemeliharaan hutan dan produksi kayu; tugas harian berbeda menurut lokasi dan rencana. Kru perlu mengetahui titik kerja, jalur keluar, cara menghubungi pemimpin, dan tempat berkumpul bila terjadi bahaya. Cuaca, medan, dan jarak dari jalan dapat mengubah kondisi; pekerja tidak mengubah rute atau tugas sendiri.`}:                  `Forestry includes forest maintenance and timber production, and daily tasks vary by site and plan. The crew must know the work location, exit routes, how to contact the leader, and where to assemble in an emergency. Weather, terrain, and distance from roads can change conditions; workers must not change routes or tasks on their own.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Pemeliharaan dapat meliputi membersihkan vegetasi pengganggu atau merawat tegakan sesuai rencana. Tanda petak dan instruksi menentukan tanaman mana yang dipertahankan; pekerja menjaga jarak aman dari rekan yang menggunakan alat. Pergerakan alat, lereng, dan vegetasi rapat memerlukan komunikasi sebelum mulai atau berpindah.`}:                                 `Maintenance may involve clearing unwanted vegetation or caring for a stand according to plan. Plot markers and instructions show which plants to keep. Maintain a safe distance from coworkers using tools. Communicate before starting or moving equipment on slopes or through dense vegetation.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Penebangan dan pengolahan kayu melibatkan pohon yang dapat jatuh, dahan, dan alat bertenaga. Rencana kerja dan pengaturan zona menentukan siapa boleh berada di mana; pekerja menjaga jarak sesuai arahan dan memakai komunikasi yang disepakati. Metode penebangan hanya dilakukan oleh orang dengan pelatihan dan penugasan yang sesuai.`}:                           `Tree felling and timber processing involve falling trees, branches, and powered equipment. The work plan and zone controls specify where each person may be; keep the instructed distance and use agreed communication. Only workers with the required training and assignment may fell trees.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Periksa area yang menjadi tanggung jawab, bawa alat kembali sesuai daftar, dan cocokkan jumlah hasil dengan catatan. Sampaikan lokasi serta status tanda, jalur, atau bahaya yang masih perlu tindak lanjut. Jangan menyatakan area aman bila belum diperiksa atau mengubah jumlah agar sesuai target.

Kasus latihan: Di akhir hari, satu alat komunikasi belum kembali dan terdapat jalur berlumpur yang perlu ditinjau ulang.
Respons yang dianjurkan: Beri tahu pemimpin sebelum meninggalkan petak, cari alat sesuai prosedur, dan catat jalur yang belum dinyatakan aman.`}: `Inspect your assigned area, return tools according to the checklist, and compare output quantities with the records. Report locations and the status of markers, routes, or hazards requiring follow-up. Do not declare an area safe if it has not been inspected, or alter quantities to meet a target.

Practice scenario: At the end of the day, one communication device is missing, and a muddy route needs another check.
Suggested response: Tell the leader before leaving the plot, look for the device according to procedure, and record that the route has not been declared safe.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Pisahkan bibit yang kering, patah, atau tidak sesuai catatan lalu laporkan jumlahnya. Bawa bibit dengan cara yang tidak merusak akar, tanam pada titik yang ditandai, dan pastikan tanah menutup sesuai instruksi. Jika titik tertutup batu atau genangan, jangan memilih posisi baru sendiri; minta arahan.

Kasus latihan: Di satu bundel terdapat bibit dengan label jenis berbeda dari petak yang sedang ditanami.
Respons yang dianjurkan: Pisahkan bundel itu, jangan tanam, dan minta pemimpin memastikan jenis bibit sebelum pekerjaan dilanjutkan.`}: `Set aside dry, broken, or record-mismatched seedlings and report the quantity. Carry them without damaging the roots, plant at marked points, and cover them with soil as instructed. If a point is blocked by a rock or standing water, do not choose a new position yourself; ask for guidance.

Practice scenario: A bundle contains seedlings labeled as a different species from the one assigned to the plot.
Suggested response: Set the bundle aside, do not plant it, and ask the leader to verify the species before work resumes.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Sebelum bekerja, periksa kerusakan, ukuran, pengencang, dan kecocokan perlengkapan. Bila helm retak, tali rusak, atau pelindung tidak sesuai, jangan mulai; minta penggantian. Jangan meminjam atau mengoperasikan alat yang belum diajarkan kepada Anda, sekalipun rekan meminta bantuan cepat.

Kasus latihan: Rekan meminta pekerja baru menggunakan gergaji mesin, tetapi ia belum mengikuti pelatihan yang diwajibkan.
Respons yang dianjurkan: Tolak dengan sopan, jangan menyalakan gergaji, dan beri tahu pemimpin agar pekerjaan diberikan kepada orang yang berwenang.`}: `Before work, check equipment for damage, fit, fasteners, and suitability. If a helmet is cracked, a strap is damaged, or protection is unsuitable, do not start; request a replacement. Do not borrow or operate equipment you have not been trained to use, even if a coworker asks for quick help.

Practice scenario: A coworker asks a new worker to use a chainsaw, but the worker has not completed the required training.
Suggested response: Politely refuse, do not start the saw, and tell the leader so the task can be assigned to an authorized person.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Sebelum berangkat, dengarkan arahan, ulangi lokasi dan tugas, periksa alat komunikasi, dan pastikan siapa yang menjadi kontak. Beri tahu kru jika baterai radio lemah atau jalur tidak dapat dilalui. Bila cuaca memburuk atau rencana tidak jelas, hentikan persiapan dan minta konfirmasi.

Kasus latihan: Pekerja menerima peta dengan titik kerja baru, tetapi radio tidak dapat tersambung dengan pemimpin.
Respons yang dianjurkan: Jangan masuk ke lokasi. Periksa alat sesuai instruksi dan laporkan gangguan komunikasi agar jalur kontak dipastikan.`}: `Before departure, listen to the instructions, repeat the location and task, check communication equipment, and confirm the contact person. Tell the crew if a radio battery is low or a route is impassable. If the weather worsens or the plan is unclear, stop preparations and ask for confirmation.

Practice scenario: A worker receives a map with a new work point, but the radio cannot connect to the leader.
Suggested response: Do not enter the site. Check the equipment as instructed and report the communication problem so a contact route can be confirmed.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Sebelum membersihkan, identifikasi tanaman sasaran dan yang harus dibiarkan. Pastikan rekan mengetahui posisi Anda, gunakan alat sesuai pelatihan, dan berhenti jika seseorang masuk ke zona kerja. Bila tanda tidak jelas atau ada bibit yang rusak, tandai lokasi dan laporkan, jangan meneruskan berdasarkan tebakan.

Kasus latihan: Tanda tanaman sasaran tertutup semak, sementara seorang rekan bergerak di sisi lereng yang sama.
Respons yang dianjurkan: Hentikan alat, panggil rekan dan pemimpin, lalu pastikan batas sasaran serta jarak aman sebelum bekerja lagi.`}: `Before clearing vegetation, identify the target plants and those that must remain. Make sure coworkers know your position, use tools only as trained, and stop if someone enters the work zone. If a marker is unclear or a seedling is damaged, mark the location and report it; do not proceed by guessing.

Practice scenario: Brush covers the target-plant marker while a coworker is moving on the same slope.
Suggested response: Stop the tool, call the coworker and leader, and confirm the target boundary and safe distance before resuming.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Sebelum menanam, kru memastikan batas petak, jenis pekerjaan, jarak, alat, serta titik yang harus dihindari. Tanah dan vegetasi menjaga fungsi hutan; jalur yang tidak direncanakan dapat menyebabkan erosi atau kerusakan akar. Peta dan tanda lapangan harus dicocokkan sebelum area dibuka.`}: `Before planting, confirm plot boundaries, the task, spacing, tools, and areas to avoid. Soil and vegetation help maintain forest functions; unplanned routes can cause erosion or damage roots. Match the map to field markers before opening an area.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Sebelum mendekati lokasi, pastikan kru memberi tanda bahwa area aman untuk lewat. Bila tidak melihat pekerja atau tidak menerima isyarat yang dipahami, berhenti di batas dan hubungi pemimpin. Jangan mencoba menilai arah jatuh atau mendekati pohon yang masih bergerak.

Kasus latihan: Pekerja perlu mengambil alat di sisi lain zona, tetapi tidak melihat kru dan tidak mendengar tanda aman.
Respons yang dianjurkan: Tetap di luar batas, hubungi pemimpin melalui cara yang ditetapkan, dan masuk hanya setelah menerima izin yang jelas.`}: `Before approaching, make sure the crew has signaled that the area is safe to cross. If you cannot see the workers or have not received a signal you understand, stop at the boundary and contact the leader. Do not try to predict a tree's fall direction or approach a tree that is still moving.

Practice scenario: A worker needs to retrieve a tool on the other side of a zone but cannot see the crew or hear an all-clear signal.
Suggested response: Stay outside the boundary, contact the leader using the designated method, and enter only after receiving clear permission.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Tanah hutan menahan air dan mendukung pertumbuhan; lintasan alat dan pekerjaan yang tidak sesuai dapat menggerus permukaan atau membawa sedimen ke aliran. Petak dan rute yang ditandai membantu mengurangi gangguan. Bila pekerja menemukan genangan, tanah tergerus, atau kebocoran bahan, ia melapor dan tidak memindahkan material sendiri.`}: `Forest soil stores water and supports growth. Equipment routes and unsuitable work can erode the surface or carry sediment into waterways. Marked plots and routes help limit disturbance. If a worker finds standing water, erosion, or a material leak, report it and do not move the material yourself.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Tetap di lokasi tunggu yang ditentukan, jaga kontak visual dengan pemberi isyarat, dan jangan melintas di belakang alat bergerak. Bila beban bergeser, suara peringatan terdengar, atau orang masuk ke jalur, beri tanda berhenti sesuai prosedur dan menjauh ke tempat aman. Laporkan kerusakan atau kondisi jalan.

Kasus latihan: Satu batang bergeser pada muatan alat berat, sedangkan pekerja berdiri di jalur samping untuk memberi isyarat.
Respons yang dianjurkan: Berikan tanda berhenti sesuai prosedur dan pindah ke zona aman; beri tahu operator serta pemimpin tentang batang yang bergeser.`}: `Stay in the designated waiting area, maintain visual contact with the signaler, and do not cross behind moving equipment. If a load shifts, a warning sounds, or someone enters the route, give the stop signal according to procedure and move to a safe place. Report damage or road conditions.

Practice scenario: A log shifts on a heavy-equipment load while a worker stands beside the route to signal.
Suggested response: Give the stop signal as required and move to the safe zone; tell the operator and leader that the log has shifted.`,

	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Melaporkan pohon sakit, api, dan limbah`}:       `Reporting Diseased Trees, Fires, and Waste`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Melindungi tanah dan aliran air`}:               `Protecting Soil and Waterways`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Membaca medan dan mengenali bahaya`}:            `Reading Terrain and Recognizing Hazards`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Pemeliharaan vegetasi dan keselamatan rekan`}:   `Vegetation Maintenance and Coworker Safety`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Pemeriksaan akhir petak dan laporan pekerjaan`}: `Final Plot Checks and Work Reports`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Pemilihan bibit dan penanaman`}:                 `Seedling Selection and Planting`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Pemindahan kayu dan keselamatan alat berat`}:    `Timber Handling and Heavy-Equipment Safety`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Pengenalan kayu dan penandaan hasil`}:           `Identifying Timber and Marking Products`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Perlengkapan pelindung dan batas tugas`}:        `Protective Equipment and Work Limits`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Persiapan petak tanam dan perlindungan tanah`}:  `Preparing Planting Plots and Protecting Soil`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Rencana kerja, lokasi, dan komunikasi darurat`}: `Work Plans, Locations, and Emergency Communication`,
	{field: "ssw.title", source: `Zona kerja penebangan dan tanda komunikasi`}:    `Felling Zones and Communication Signals`,

	{field: "ssw.description", source: `Memahami zona kerja produksi kayu, tanda komunikasi, dan pemindahan hasil hanya sesuai peran serta prosedur keselamatan.`}:                   `Understand timber-production work zones, communication signals, and how to move products only within your role and safety procedures.`,
	{field: "ssw.description", source: `Membaca rencana kerja, mengenali kondisi lokasi, dan memastikan komunikasi, perlindungan diri, serta batas tugas sebelum bekerja di hutan.`}: `Read the work plan, assess site conditions, and confirm communication, personal protection, and task limits before working in the forest.`,
	{field: "ssw.description", source: `Mengenali pekerjaan penanaman dan pemeliharaan hutan, menjaga bibit serta tanah, dan mengikuti instruksi pada tiap petak.`}:                  `Understand forest planting and maintenance, protect seedlings and soil, and follow the instructions for each plot.`,
	{field: "ssw.description", source: `Menjaga tanah, air, dan lingkungan sekitar serta melaporkan kondisi yang mengganggu pekerjaan atau pemulihan petak.`}:                        `Protect soil, water, and the surrounding environment, and report conditions that disrupt work or plot recovery.`,

	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan berjalan di bawah cabang menggantung atau melintas pada lereng yang dinilai tidak aman.`}: `Do not walk beneath hanging branches or cross a slope that has been judged unsafe.`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan berjalan di jalur alat berat atau di bawah kayu yang sedang terangkat.`}:                  `Do not walk in a heavy-equipment route or beneath raised timber.`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan memasuki lokasi kerja sendiri atau berpindah area tanpa memberi tahu kru.`}:               `Do not enter the work site alone or move to another area without telling the crew.`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan memasuki zona penebangan atau mendekati pohon yang belum dinyatakan aman.`}:               `Do not enter the felling zone or approach a tree that has not been declared safe.`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan membuang bahan atau mengalihkan aliran air tanpa instruksi.`}:                             `Do not dump materials or divert water flow without instructions.`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan membuka petak atau jalur di luar batas rencana.`}:                                         `Do not clear a plot or route beyond the planned boundary.`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan mencampur jenis bibit atau mengubah pola tanam tanpa persetujuan.`}:                       `Do not mix seedling species or change the planting pattern without approval.`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan mendekati api, wadah bocor, atau pohon berbahaya untuk mengambil foto atau sampel.`}:      `Do not approach a fire, leaking container, or hazardous tree to take a photo or sample.`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan menggunakan alat saat rekan berada terlalu dekat atau target pemeliharaan belum pasti.`}:  `Do not use a tool when a coworker is too close or the maintenance target is uncertain.`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan mengoperasikan gergaji mesin atau alat berbahaya di luar pelatihan dan penugasan.`}:       `Do not operate a chainsaw or hazardous equipment without the required training and assignment.`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan mengubah tanda kayu atau mencampur kelompok tanpa otorisasi.`}:                            `Do not change timber markings or combine groups without authorization.`,
	{field: "ssw.caution", source: `Jangan meninggalkan alat atau masalah terbuka tanpa tanda dan laporan.`}:                         `Do not leave equipment or an unresolved issue without marking and reporting it.`,

	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Melakukan pemeliharaan vegetasi sesuai tanda petak sambil menjaga jarak dan menghindari bibit yang dipertahankan.`}:       `Maintain vegetation according to plot markers, keep a safe distance, and avoid seedlings designated to remain.`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Memeriksa jenis, jumlah, serta kondisi bibit dan menanam mengikuti jarak serta cara yang ditunjukkan.`}:                   `Check seedling species, quantity, and condition, then plant them using the specified spacing and method.`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Memeriksa lokasi kerja, tugas, rute, kondisi cuaca, dan cara meminta bantuan sebelum masuk ke area hutan.`}:               `Check the work location, task, route, weather, and how to request help before entering the forest area.`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Memeriksa perlengkapan pelindung dan hanya melakukan pekerjaan yang sesuai pelatihan serta arahan.`}:                      `Check protective equipment and perform only work covered by your training and instructions.`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Mengamati lereng, pijakan, pohon rusak, batu, cabang jatuh, dan perubahan cuaca sebelum bergerak.`}:                       `Check slopes, footing, damaged trees, rocks, fallen branches, and weather changes before moving.`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Mengenali batas zona berbahaya, mengikuti tanda kru, dan tidak masuk ke area penebangan tanpa izin.`}:                     `Identify hazardous-zone boundaries, follow crew signals, and do not enter a felling area without permission.`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Mengenali tanda lingkungan yang tidak biasa dan melaporkannya tanpa menyentuh atau memindahkan sumber bahaya.`}:           `Recognize unusual environmental signs and report them without touching or moving the hazard.`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Menghitung hasil, mengumpulkan alat, mencatat bahaya atau pekerjaan tertunda, dan menyerahkannya kepada pemimpin.`}:       `Count the output, collect tools, record hazards or unfinished work, and report them to the leader.`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Mengikuti jalur yang ditetapkan, menjaga tepi aliran dan area sensitif, serta melaporkan erosi atau kebocoran.`}:          `Use designated routes, protect stream edges and sensitive areas, and report erosion or leaks.`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Menjaga identitas kayu hasil kerja dengan membaca tanda, ukuran atau kelompok yang dicatat, serta melaporkan kerusakan.`}: `Maintain timber identity by checking its marks, recorded size or group, and report any damage.`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Menjaga jarak dari mesin pemindah, mengikuti arahan operator, serta memastikan area muat aman sebelum mendekat.`}:         `Keep clear of timber-moving equipment, follow the operator's directions, and confirm the loading area is safe before approaching.`,
	{field: "ssw.objective", source: `Menyiapkan petak tanam sesuai rencana dan menjaga jalur kerja agar tidak merusak tanah atau saluran air.`}:                `Prepare planting plots according to plan and keep work routes from damaging soil or waterways.`,

	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Di akhir hari, satu alat komunikasi belum kembali dan terdapat jalur berlumpur yang perlu ditinjau ulang.`}:                      `At the end of the day, one communication device has not been returned, and a muddy route needs to be reviewed.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Di satu bundel terdapat bibit dengan label jenis berbeda dari petak yang sedang ditanami.`}:                                      `One bundle contains seedlings labeled as a different species from the one being planted in the plot.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Pekerja melihat asap tipis dan bau hangus dari area yang belum diperiksa.`}:                                                      `A worker sees light smoke and smells something burning in an area that has not been inspected.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Pekerja menerima peta dengan titik kerja baru, tetapi radio tidak dapat tersambung dengan pemimpin.`}:                            `A worker receives a map showing a new work point, but the radio cannot connect to the leader.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Pekerja perlu mengambil alat di sisi lain zona, tetapi tidak melihat kru dan tidak mendengar tanda aman.`}:                       `A worker needs to retrieve a tool from the other side of a zone but cannot see the crew or hear an all-clear signal.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Rekan meminta pekerja baru menggunakan gergaji mesin, tetapi ia belum mengikuti pelatihan yang diwajibkan.`}:                     `A coworker asks a new worker to use a chainsaw, but the worker has not completed the required training.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Roda kendaraan meninggalkan alur dalam yang mengarah ke saluran air setelah hujan.`}:                                             `After rain, a vehicle wheel leaves a deep rut leading toward a water channel.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Satu batang bergeser pada muatan alat berat, sedangkan pekerja berdiri di jalur samping untuk memberi isyarat.`}:                 `A log shifts on a heavy-equipment load while a worker stands beside the route to signal.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Satu batang kayu di tempat pengumpulan tidak memiliki tanda petak, sementara dua kelompok dari petak berbeda sedang disiapkan.`}: `A log at the collection point has no plot mark while two groups from different plots are being prepared.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Setelah hujan, jalur ke titik kerja memiliki tanah yang ambles dan satu cabang besar menggantung di atas lintasan.`}:             `After rain, the path to the work site has subsided ground, and a large branch hangs over the route.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Tanda batas petak tidak terlihat di satu sisi dan jalur kerja mengarah ke dekat aliran air.`}:                                    `A plot boundary marker is missing on one side, and the work route leads close to a stream.`,
	{field: "ssw.scenario", source: `Tanda tanaman sasaran tertutup semak, sementara seorang rekan bergerak di sisi lereng yang sama.`}:                               `Brush covers the target-plant marker while a coworker is moving on the same slope.`,

	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Berhenti sebelum batas yang diragukan, hindari memasuki area dekat aliran, dan minta pemimpin mengonfirmasi peta serta tanda.`}:        `Stop before the uncertain boundary, stay clear of the stream area, and ask the leader to confirm the map and markers.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Beri tahu pemimpin sebelum meninggalkan petak, cari alat sesuai prosedur, dan catat jalur yang belum dinyatakan aman.`}:                `Tell the leader before leaving the plot, look for the device according to procedure, and record that the route has not been declared safe.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Berikan tanda berhenti sesuai prosedur dan pindah ke zona aman; beri tahu operator serta pemimpin tentang batang yang bergeser.`}:      `Give the stop signal as required and move to the safe zone; tell the operator and leader that the log has shifted.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Hentikan alat, panggil rekan dan pemimpin, lalu pastikan batas sasaran serta jarak aman sebelum bekerja lagi.`}:                        `Stop the tool, call the coworker and leader, and confirm the target boundary and safe distance before resuming.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Hentikan kendaraan di tempat aman, laporkan alur dan arah aliran, lalu tunggu keputusan pemimpin mengenai rute berikutnya.`}:           `Stop the vehicle in a safe place, report the rut and direction of flow, then wait for the leader to decide on the next route.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Jangan masuk ke lokasi. Periksa alat sesuai instruksi dan laporkan gangguan komunikasi agar jalur kontak dipastikan.`}:                 `Do not enter the site. Check the equipment as instructed and report the communication problem so a contact route can be confirmed.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Jangan melewati titik itu. Beri tanda atau jarak aman sesuai aturan kru dan laporkan agar pemimpin memilih jalur atau tindakan aman.`}: `Do not pass that point. Mark it or keep a safe distance as the crew requires, and report it so the leader can choose a safe route or action.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Jauhi area, beri tahu kru dan pemimpin melalui jalur darurat, lalu ikuti rute evakuasi yang ditentukan.`}:                              `Stay away, alert the crew and leader through the emergency channel, and follow the designated evacuation route.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Pisahkan batang itu di tempat tahan, catat lokasi dan kondisi, lalu minta pemimpin menelusuri identitas sebelum dimuat.`}:              `Isolate the log in the hold area, record its location and condition, and ask the leader to trace its identity before loading.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Pisahkan bundel itu, jangan tanam, dan minta pemimpin memastikan jenis bibit sebelum pekerjaan dilanjutkan.`}:                          `Set the bundle aside, do not plant it, and ask the leader to verify the species before work resumes.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Tetap di luar batas, hubungi pemimpin melalui cara yang ditetapkan, dan masuk hanya setelah menerima izin yang jelas.`}:                `Stay outside the boundary, contact the leader using the designated method, and enter only after receiving clear permission.`,
	{field: "ssw.response", source: `Tolak dengan sopan, jangan menyalakan gergaji, dan beri tahu pemimpin agar pekerjaan diberikan kepada orang yang berwenang.`}:          `Politely refuse, do not start the saw, and tell the leader so the task can be assigned to an authorized person.`,

	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Amati medan dan cuaca dari titik aman`}:                              `Assess terrain and weather from a safe point`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Amati perubahan tanah atau aliran`}:                                  `Watch for changes in the ground or water flow`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Amati tanda tidak biasa dari jarak aman`}:                            `Observe unusual signs from a safe distance`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Baca atau dengarkan rencana kerja hari ini`}:                         `Read or listen to today's work plan`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Baca jenis tugas dan perlengkapan yang diwajibkan`}:                  `Review the task and required equipment`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Baca tanda petak dan kelompok kayu`}:                                 `Check plot and timber-group markers`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Baca tanda tanaman dan sasaran pemeliharaan`}:                        `Check plant markers and maintenance targets`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Catat bibit rusak atau titik yang tidak dapat ditanami`}:             `Record damaged seedlings or spots that cannot be planted`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Catat hasil aktual dan masalah yang belum selesai`}:                  `Record actual output and unresolved issues`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Catat jumlah serta laporkan selisih`}:                                `Record the quantity and report discrepancies`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Catat lokasi, waktu, dan ciri yang terlihat`}:                        `Record the location, time, and visible signs`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Cocokkan jenis dan jumlah bibit dengan catatan`}:                     `Match seedling species and quantity to the records`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Cocokkan label dengan catatan kerja`}:                                `Match the label to the work records`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Cocokkan peta dan tanda batas petak`}:                                `Compare the map with plot boundary markers`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Gunakan jalur yang disetujui dan tinjau ulang bila kondisi berubah`}: `Use approved routes and reassess if conditions change`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Gunakan rute yang ditentukan untuk orang dan alat`}:                  `Use the designated routes for people and equipment`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Hentikan alat dan laporkan bila tanda atau posisi tidak jelas`}:      `Stop the tool and report unclear markers or positions`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Identifikasi batas zona kerja dari tanda kru`}:                       `Identify work-zone boundaries from crew markers`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Jaga jarak dari pekerjaan berbahaya`}:                                `Keep clear of hazardous work`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Jangan mendekati atau berdiri di bawah beban`}:                       `Do not approach or stand beneath a load`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Jauhi area dan ikuti arahan penanggung jawab`}:                       `Stay away and follow the person in charge's instructions`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Kenali bahaya di atas, bawah, dan sepanjang jalur`}:                  `Look for hazards above, below, and along the route`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Kenali jalur kendaraan dan titik buta`}:                              `Identify vehicle routes and blind spots`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Kerjakan hanya vegetasi yang ditetapkan`}:                            `Work only on designated vegetation`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Kumpulkan dan cocokkan alat dengan daftar`}:                          `Collect the tools and check them against the list`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Laporkan batas atau tanda yang tidak jelas`}:                         `Report unclear boundaries or markers`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Laporkan erosi, tumpahan, atau gangguan yang terlihat`}:              `Report visible erosion, spills, or other disturbances`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Laporkan kerusakan dan ganti sebelum bekerja`}:                       `Report damage and replace the item before work`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Laporkan pergeseran beban atau bahaya lintasan`}:                     `Report shifting loads or route hazards`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Laporkan tanda yang hilang atau orang masuk zona`}:                   `Report missing markers or anyone entering the zone`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Pastikan jalur dan area yang harus dilindungi`}:                      `Confirm the route and areas that must be protected`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Pastikan jarak aman serta komunikasi dengan rekan`}:                  `Confirm a safe distance and communication with coworkers`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Pastikan komunikasi dua arah dan izin lewat`}:                        `Confirm two-way communication and permission to pass`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Pastikan lokasi, tugas, dan rute masuk-keluar`}:                      `Confirm the location, task, and entry and exit routes`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Pastikan tugas sesuai pelatihan dan arahan`}:                         `Confirm that the task matches your training and instructions`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Periksa alat komunikasi dan kontak darurat`}:                         `Check communication equipment and emergency contacts`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Periksa kondisi bibit sebelum dibawa`}:                               `Check seedling condition before carrying them`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Periksa kondisi serta kecocokan perlengkapan`}:                       `Check the condition and suitability of equipment`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Periksa petak serta pastikan kru lengkap`}:                           `Inspect the plot and confirm all crew members are present`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Periksa tanda jalur dan area sensitif`}:                              `Check route markers and sensitive areas`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Peringatkan kru melalui cara komunikasi yang ditetapkan`}:            `Warn the crew using the designated communication method`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Pisahkan kayu tanpa identitas atau rusak`}:                           `Set aside unidentified or damaged timber`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Serahkan laporan kepada pemimpin sebelum meninggalkan lokasi`}:       `Give the report to the leader before leaving the site`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Siapkan alat pada tempat yang aman`}:                                 `Place the tools in a safe location`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Tanam pada titik dan jarak yang ditunjukkan`}:                        `Plant at the marked points and spacing`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Tandai atau laporkan bahaya kepada kru`}:                             `Mark the hazard or report it to the crew`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Tunggu di zona aman dan pastikan isyarat dipahami`}:                  `Wait in the safe zone and confirm the signal is understood`,
	{field: "ssw.step", source: `Ulangi instruksi yang belum dipahami sebelum berangkat`}:             `Repeat any unclear instructions before departure`,

	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `alat berat`}:                                                             `heavy equipment`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `asap`}:                                                                   `smoke`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `batas`}:                                                                  `boundary`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Batas ini tidak terlihat. Mohon periksa peta.`}:                          `This boundary is not visible. Please check the map.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `berhenti`}:                                                               `stop`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `bibit pohon`}:                                                            `tree seedling`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Bolehkah saya masuk ke zona kerja?`}:                                     `May I enter the work zone?`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Bolehkah saya menanam di tempat ini?`}:                                   `May I plant here?`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `cabang jatuh`}:                                                           `fallen branch`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `catatan kerja`}:                                                          `work record`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `erosi`}:                                                                  `erosion`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Helm ini retak. Mohon ganti.`}:                                           `This helmet is cracked. Please replace it.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Jangan masuk dulu. Tunggu isyarat aman.`}:                                `Do not enter yet. Wait for the all-clear signal.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Jangan mendekat, hubungi penanggung jawab.`}:                             `Do not approach. Contact the person in charge.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `jarak`}:                                                                  `distance`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Jenis bibit ini tampaknya berbeda. Mohon periksa.`}:                      `This seedling species appears to be different. Please check it.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `jumlah batang`}:                                                          `number of logs`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Kayu gelondong bergerak. Mohon hentikan pekerjaan.`}:                     `The log is moving. Please stop work.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Kayu gelondong ini tidak memiliki tanda.`}:                               `This log has no markings.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `kayu gelondongan`}:                                                       `log`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `kerusakan atau dampak`}:                                                  `damage or impact`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `kualifikasi`}:                                                            `qualification`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `laporan darurat`}:                                                        `emergency report`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `lereng`}:                                                                 `slope`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `menjauh atau evakuasi`}:                                                  `move away or evacuate`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Mohon beri tahu sekali lagi lokasi kerja hari ini.`}:                     `Please tell me today's work location again.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `muatan`}:                                                                 `load`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `pelatihan`}:                                                              `training`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `pembersihan vegetasi bawah`}:                                             `understory clearing`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `penanaman`}:                                                              `planting`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `penebangan pohon`}:                                                       `tree felling`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `pengumpulan kayu`}:                                                       `timber collection`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `perlindungan`}:                                                           `protection`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `petak tanam`}:                                                            `planting plot`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `pijakan`}:                                                                `footing`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Radio tidak tersambung. Saya akan melapor kepada penanggung jawab.`}:     `The radio is not connecting. I will report it to the person in charge.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Satu radio kurang.`}:                                                     `One radio is missing.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya akan memastikan jalur aman kepada penanggung jawab.`}:               `I will confirm with the person in charge that the route is safe.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya belum mengikuti pelatihan. Saya belum dapat mengoperasikannya.`}:    `I have not completed the training. I cannot operate it yet.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya melihat asap. Lokasinya di lereng utara.`}:                          `I see smoke. It is on the north slope.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya mencatat lokasinya dan meminta konfirmasi penanggung jawab.`}:       `I will record the location and ask the person in charge to confirm it.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya menyerahkan jalur yang belum diperiksa kepada penanggung jawab.`}:   `I will report the unchecked route to the person in charge.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya mulai setelah memastikan jarak dari rekan.`}:                        `I will start after confirming my distance from the coworker.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya mundur ke tempat aman.`}:                                            `I will move back to a safe place.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya tidak masuk dekat air dan akan bertanya kepada penanggung jawab.`}:  `I will stay away from the water and ask the person in charge.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Saya tidak memakai jalur ini dan akan melapor kepada penanggung jawab.`}: `I will not use this route; I will report it to the person in charge.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `tanah`}:                                                                  `soil`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Tanah di sini longsor. Jangan lewat.`}:                                   `The ground is sliding here. Do not pass.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Tanah mengalir ke saluran air.`}:                                         `Soil is washing into the water channel.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `tanda atau label`}:                                                       `mark or label`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `Tanda tidak terlihat. Saya menghentikan pekerjaan.`}:                     `The marker is not visible. I am stopping work.`,
	{field: "ssw.meaning", source: `tempat evakuasi`}:                                                        `evacuation point`,
}
